    "created": "2026-10-13T00:00:00+00:00",
    "description": "The outer loop of a structural sizing: a parametric study over the stringer counts of the crown and of the upper sides of a fuselage barrel, each architecture planned by nastran_architecture, built by the stand-in producer of nastran_refmodels from its plan, loaded by nastran_loads and sized by gemseo_nastran.\n\nIt needs the packages gemseo_nastran, nastran_architecture, nastran_loads and nastran_refmodels in the Python of the runs. A run takes a few minutes; the store of gemseo_nastran keeps every architecture sized, and a study run again reuses them.",
    "gpb_version": "0.1.0",
    "name": "Architecture study"
  },
